-   detail
+   detail

-       An object which is `java.time.Instant is Abstractable across Instants to Long` and
-       `java.time.Instant is Instantiable across Instants from Long`, offered as the given
-       `instantInterfaces.javaTimeInstant`, imported by name, so that a time read from a file
-       or a clock can arrive as a `java.time.Instant`.
+       Un oggetto che è `java.time.Instant is Abstractable across Instants to Long` e
+       `java.time.Instant is Instantiable across Instants from Long`, offerto come given
+       `instantInterfaces.javaTimeInstant`, importato per nome, così che un tempo letto da un
+       file o da un orologio possa arrivare come `java.time.Instant`.

=       or a clock can arrive as a `java.time.Instant`.
